  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "虛擬實境建築空間創新應用",
    "sub_ename": "THE INNOVATIVE APPLICATION OF VIRTUAL ARCHITECTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將指導學生使用Unity來進行虛擬空間之互動設計應用。Unity的學習過程也能讓學生學習C#程式編輯，使學生能進一步掌握AR及VR的應用技術，提升學生未來創新應用與思維能力。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "he main purpose of this course is teaching students how to use Unity to practice interactive design  in virtual Architecture. In the process of learning Unity, Students can understand coding concept by C# programming practices, and get the important skills to further study the applications of AR and VR in order to improve the comprehensive innovation abilities for students.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
